+        convert h using 1
+        · simp
+        · rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_eq_self.mpr <| mul_nonneg hC.le this]
+      · simpa only [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_pos]
+    · linarith [(div_nonneg ha.1.le (Real.log_nonneg (by linarith)) : 0 ≤ A / Real.log |2 * t|)]
