+      Set.indicator (Set.Icc b c) 1 ≤ Ψ ∧ Ψ ≤ Set.indicator (Set.Ioo a d) 1 := by
+  obtain ⟨ψ, l1, l2, l3, l4, -⟩ := smooth_urysohn_support_Ioo h1 h3
